# Allowlist (task 3.1): the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out of
# the Docker daemon and of every image layer, above all .env with the real API key.
# Per module (task 4.1): its pom.xml and src/main, never its tests or target/.
*
!mvnw
!.mvn/
!pom.xml
!libs/*/pom.xml
!libs/*/src/main/
!app/pom.xml
!app/src/main/
